        "name": "Lair Action",
        "actionType": "lair",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p>A thunderclap originates at a point the dragon can see within 120 feet of it. Each creature within a 20-foot radius centered on that point must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or take 5 (1d10) thunder damage and be deafened until the end of its next turn.</p>",
